  "details": "Any uploaded world can be accessed by any person who has the blueprint ID. But this information is not made clear or explicit to world uploaders.\nAlso, blueprint IDs are easier to attain than most people realize; for example, anybody who's visited a world can retrieve the ID from their logs.\nNaming non-public worlds as \"Unlisted\" isn't quite explicit enough to make it broadly understood.\nPlease include a notice in the SDK upon world upload that non-published worlds are not private.",
